{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Sit Buddy 是一款專注計時工具，畫面中有一隻小貓坐在身旁陪伴。開始前可選擇讀書、工作、閱讀、寫作、運動、冥想等模式，或自行輸入名稱，把手機反轉向下或按下按鈕即可開始。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>貓咪陪伴的專注計時</h2>\n<p>每次專注可設定 1 至 240 分鐘，並有常用預設，結束後可選 5 或 10 分鐘休息。可播放安靜、雨聲或壁爐聲，鎖定畫面顯示剩餘時間；中途拿起手機同樣會被記錄。輕觸或長按可與小貓互動。專注超過一分鐘即寫入日記，並提供總計、七日趨勢與日曆，累積足夠可獲印章。全程無帳號與廣告，紀錄只留在本機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-350-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-351-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-352-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-353-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-354-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sit Buddy-Pomodoro focus cat</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T06:42:30.247600+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}